<!-- ════════════════ 45 · GUARDRAILS (BUDGET != CAP) ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Guardrails" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #0d9488;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">45</span>FinOps</p>
          <h2 class="h2">A budget is an <span class="accent">alarm</span>, not a brake.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="problist">
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Budget &ne; cap</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Cloud and provider budgets warn you, but don't stop usage. They just let the spend continue.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Runaway agent</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>A loop that reads hundreds of files or keeps retrying can run up a large bill in hours.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Set a real brake</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Per-workspace spend limits (Anthropic Console), team limits (Copilot &ldquo;stop usage at budget&rdquo;, Cursor) and <code>max_turns</code> / <code>max_budget_usd</code> in the Agent SDK.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Set a hard limit per key and per session. <strong>Don't rely on the monthly budget alone</strong>.
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;"><strong>Sources:</strong> GCP &amp; Azure docs: &ldquo;Setting a budget does not... cap usage&rdquo; / &ldquo;consumption isn't stopped&rdquo; &middot; Anthropic Console spend limits &middot; GitHub Copilot &amp; Cursor spend limits &middot; Claude Agent SDK: <code>max_turns</code>/<code>max_budget_usd</code> (Python), <code>maxTurns</code>/<code>maxBudgetUsd</code> (TypeScript).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "45" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "57" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
